{"ref":"BDB, מִכְמָר","hw":"מִכְמָר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִכְמָר</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>net, snare</strong>, bringing an animal to its fall, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּתוֹא מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.20\">Is 51:20</a> <em>like an antelope of</em> (<em>in</em>) <em>a net</em> or <em>snare</em> (cf. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֵ֫רֶם²\" href=\"/BDB,_חֵ֫רֶם²\", dir=\"rtl\">חֵרֶם</a> p. 357, ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רֶ֫שֶׁת\" href=\"/BDB,_רֶ֫שֶׁת\", dir=\"rtl\">רֶשֶׁת</a> p. 440).","next":"BDB, מַכְמֹר","prev":"BDB, כמר²"}